1-21T18:35:52-05:00","product_id":8559848849639,"variant_ids":[51705481822439,51705481920743,51705481953511],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-8029.png?v=1769038552","width":1024,"height":1024},{"id":48918270017767,"created_at":"2026-01-21T18:35:51-05:00","position":4,"updated_at":"2026-01-21T18:35:52-05:00","product_id":8559848849639,"variant_ids":[51705481789671,51705481855207,51705481887975,51705481986279],"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-8030.png?v=1769038552","width":1024,"height":1024}],"options":[{"name":"Size","position":1,"values":["Small","Medium","Large","X-Large","XX-Large","XXX-Large","4X-Large"]},{"name":"Color","position":2,"values":["Navy","Black"]}]},{"id":8541616832743,"title":"New York City Arteries Premium Beanies","handle":"new-york-city-arteries-black-beanie","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eArteries reimagines the NYC Subway Map as a heart, celebrating PJ O’Rourke’s deep connection to the subway \u0026amp; the MTA’s impact on his life. Shifting NYC’s boroughs into a heart shape, the subway lines become intricate veins \u0026amp; arteries, highlighting the city’s lifeblood. This art piece underscores the subway’s crucial role in NYC’s vitality \u0026amp; invites viewers to appreciate its heartbeat.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis well-structured beanie is built with intention; thick, durable, \u0026amp; architectural. The Blackout Grey palette lets the embroidered artery patch speak quietly but powerfully; like a pulse beneath concrete. Black is a classic go to. Inspired by the subway system as the city’s circulatory system, the design maps NYC as a living organism; alive, layered, \u0026amp; relentless.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCrafted from 100% acrylic, the knit holds its shape while delivering warmth without bulk. The structure gives it a clean silhouette whether worn cuffed or low; making it a true everyday piece with backbone.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDetails-\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003e100% acrylic\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBlackout Grey \u0026amp; Black colorway\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePremium embroidered NYC Arteries patch\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDimensions; 12.5” H x 16.5” W\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDurable, warm, \u0026amp; built to last\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","published_at":"2023-11-07T18:29:18-05:00","created_at":"2023-11-07T18:29:18-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:29:21-04:00","vendor":"PJ O'Rourke","product_type":"","tags":["Arteries Beanie","Beanie"],"variants":[{"id":51675767308519,"title":"Blackout Grey","option1":"Blackout Grey","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":48887089299687,"product_id":8541616832743,"position":1,"created_at":"2026-01-15T21:10:36-05:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T21:10:53-05:00","alt":null,"width":1024,"height":1024,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/IMG-7609.png?v=1768529453","variant_ids":[51675767308519]},"available":true,"price":"50.00","grams":99,"compare_at_price":null,"position":1,"product_id":8541616832743,"created_at":"2026-01-05T09:26:35-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-24T07:29:21-04:00"},{"id":51739348009191,"title":"Black","option1":"Black","option2":null,"option3":null,"sku":null,"requires_shipping":true,"taxable":true,"featured_image":{"id":44515088367847,"product_id":8541616832743,"position":2,"created_at":"2025-02-13T22:42:43-05:00","updated_at":"2026-01-15T21:10:53-05:00","alt":null,"width":5616,"height":3744,"src":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0579\/8045\/3021\/files\/2.2.25_3284.jpg?v=176852945